    "text": "<p>The magnetic field at the centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;of&nbsp;the current-carrying square loop shown in the figure&nbsp;is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/5365d98f-4dbd-4b85-b8c5-b71024247ff3-image.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 183px;\" /></p>",
